      "structure_description": "Four Ce6(μ3-O)4(μ3-OH)4 hexamers alternate with four {AsIIIW9O33} units in a discrete crown-like assembly. Bridging formate ligands stabilize the hexamers; two sodium counterions occupy the central cavity.",
